Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1268
Function: pythonUnparsedEntityDecl
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyObject_CallMethod uses format "ssss" with publicId, systemId, and notationName. In libxml2, publicId can be NULL. Passing NULL to an "s" format causes a crash.

